You could find a philosophy.

01:10:22.580 --> 01:10:23.720
You write a philosophy of that.

01:10:24.520 --> 01:10:25.500
But you know what happens?

01:10:25.500 --> 01:10:27.800
you cannot act, you cannot participate.

01:10:28.280 --> 01:10:30.280
You are forseach asheni ase'ipim.

01:10:30.500 --> 01:10:31.720
You cannot do something.

01:10:32.100 --> 01:10:33.560
In order to do something,

01:10:33.980 --> 01:10:35.780
in order to be able to build something,

01:10:36.020 --> 01:10:37.320
a society, a family,

01:10:37.760 --> 01:10:40.360
a community,

01:10:41.040 --> 01:10:42.020
you have to act.

01:10:42.800 --> 01:10:45.540
And people who have this kind of synthetic views,

01:10:46.700 --> 01:10:48.560
they never, never act.

01:10:49.160 --> 01:10:50.000
As a matter of fact,

01:10:50.200 --> 01:10:51.180
this is something very interesting.

01:10:51.660 --> 01:10:53.340
This is the one difference between the philosophers

01:10:53.340 --> 01:10:54.820
and the hachams.

01:10:55.500 --> 01:10:57.900
The philosopher contemplates the truth.

01:10:58.940 --> 01:10:59.180
You know?

01:10:59.820 --> 01:11:01.660
The priest contemplates the truth.

01:11:02.340 --> 01:11:04.580
And he contemplates it because he cannot do anything.

01:11:05.200 --> 01:11:06.880
The haqqam, talmire haqqamim,

01:11:07.500 --> 01:11:08.760
marbim shalom ba'olam,

01:11:08.820 --> 01:11:11.880
they have to do something to bring harmony in this world.

01:11:12.220 --> 01:11:13.480
It's an active thing.

01:11:15.040 --> 01:11:18.260
That's the crucial difference between the haqqam and the philosopher.

01:11:18.620 --> 01:11:20.100
The philosopher, he contemplates.

01:11:20.260 --> 01:11:22.060
From the point of view of contemplative thinking,

01:11:22.060 --> 01:11:27.220
you could find a merging angle between paganism and Judaism, because you could

01:11:27.220 --> 01:11:31.120
discover it, and maybe it's true or not true, you could build a system. But that

01:11:31.120 --> 01:11:38.080
system that you build is a system that does not allow you to act. You have to

01:11:38.080 --> 01:11:48.400
have a black and white, dark and light. Hamabdil, they call it a hoist. You have to say,

01:11:48.400 --> 01:11:50.080
This is called a species halt.

01:11:51.100 --> 01:11:51.300
You know?

01:11:51.540 --> 01:11:55.120
There is a line that you draw on the desert.

01:11:55.340 --> 01:11:57.460
So you say, I'm not going to cross this.

01:11:58.820 --> 01:12:01.780
And only when people have a system, a total system,

01:12:02.560 --> 01:12:06.740
then they could be morally active.

01:12:07.060 --> 01:12:08.960
Otherwise, you're always inactive.

01:12:09.280 --> 01:12:11.000
That is more or less the point.

01:12:11.940 --> 01:12:14.360
You were just saying, you can be involved, you can be in the desert.

01:12:14.620 --> 01:12:15.100
Exactly.

01:12:15.100 --> 01:12:15.260
Exactly.

01:12:15.260 --> 01:12:19.300
Exactly, that's the, I mean, alright, you got it for me.

01:12:19.640 --> 01:12:23.560
Alright, so, anybody in the say, I really want to say Hazzan, to be Hazzan.

01:12:24.980 --> 01:12:27.700
Maybe you, you, you prayed, you prayed, Maurice?

01:12:28.260 --> 01:12:30.220
Anybody, did you pray?

01:12:32.500 --> 01:12:35.020
Anybody, who didn't pray?

01:12:35.980 --> 01:12:36.920
Yes, you prayed? Alright.

01:12:45.260 --> 01:12:47.260
Shalom.

01:13:15.260 --> 01:13:17.260
Amen.
